{"unit_id":"Fantety__dsh-pixel-studio#card-zh","repo":"Fantety/dsh-pixel-studio","commit":"cd6d97c64d8323ee217c52f81772be83e886dec8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pixel-studio 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的像素画与动画工作室，通过三个 DSH 工具把静态像素图、逐帧动画和程序化着色器渲染成对话内画布，并同时导出可使用的素材文件。你可以用字符网格、分层画面或内置模板绘制，也可以用 Lua 子集着色器生成图案和动画。主要功能包括自定义调色板与图层、动画帧和运动预设、交互式画布预览，以及 PNG、GIF、精灵表、JSON 图集和 OYPX 项目导出。它适合在 DSH 对话中制作游戏精灵、图标、场景和循环动画；生成文件写入会话工作目录中的 outputDir，默认 pixel-art，不需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:454-512","lib/plugin.js:399-441","lib/pixel/output.js:60-99"]}
{"unit_id":"Fantety__dsh-pixel-studio#card-en","repo":"Fantety/dsh-pixel-studio","commit":"cd6d97c64d8323ee217c52f81772be83e886dec8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pixel-studio adds pixel art tools to DSH Web chats. Draw with grids or templates, make animations from frames, or create patterns with a Lua-subset shader. Preview in chat and export PNG, GIF, spritesheets, atlases or OYPX projects. Files go to the session outputDir; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:454-512","lib/plugin.js:399-441","lib/pixel/output.js:60-99"]}
